  m_text: "<size=18>-There is one jackpot, Grand Jackpot in Nudge Strike.\n- Grand
    Jackpot includes progressives as well as base amount.\n- If more than one Slot
    Game wins Grand Jackpot, then award\n    progressives on top of base amount for
    the 1st Slot Game and for the\n    rest games, award base amount only.\n</size>"
